WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.791 --> 00:00:05.916
Do you know why the whole world hates a clipper?

00:00:05.916 --> 00:00:08.000
You're just a whiny little baby

00:00:08.458 --> 00:00:10.333
Who's far to slow on the flop

00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:13.333
Are you ashamed of me, Father?

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:20.041
You are the former first-team All-ACC McDonald’s
All-American Naismith Prep Player of the Year

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:21.291
And you are my son

00:00:21.541 --> 00:00:25.083
I bet you need whole new library just for all defensive plays

00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:26.500
Oh, no no no

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.500
None of that here

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.833
I say, half the defense

00:00:30.458 --> 00:00:32.791
double the offense

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.958
Oh! What happened to Lord Commander?

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:53.958
Are you OK?

00:00:53.958 --> 00:00:56.583
He was attacked...at the end of the 4th quarter

00:00:56.583 --> 00:00:57.333
by the Jester

00:00:57.333 --> 00:00:58.666
While the Rivers boy laughed

00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:00.791
I will break their ankles!

00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:01.833
Nay nay

00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:03.666
Nene’s in the other tent. Should I get him?

00:01:03.666 --> 00:01:04.666
I mean no

00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:06.916
Violence is not the answer

00:01:08.416 --> 00:01:10.458
But sometimes, it is

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:11.833
It's futile, Chris

00:01:11.833 --> 00:01:14.583
You know the gates of Stables Castle are impregnable

00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:16.291
There are other ways in!

00:01:17.041 --> 00:01:19.208
Now House Clippers share their castle with House Lakers

00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:21.125
which means doubly fortified walls

00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:24.208
They were reinforced to protect Kobe from Shaq after his exile

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:27.083
And then re-reinforced to protect Kobe from Dwight

00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:30.708
And then re-re-reinforced to protect Kobe from trying to unretire

00:01:31.041 --> 00:01:32.041
It won't be easy

00:01:32.041 --> 00:01:33.291
I’ll need our best five

00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:36.166
So that’s me, James, Clint, Trevor, Eric...

00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:38.750
or Ryan...wait no

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.583
We need someone expendable...a journeyman

00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:43.125
You. What’s your name?

00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:44.666
Green, ser. Just signed a 10-day

00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:45.416
You're in

00:01:45.791 --> 00:01:48.375
The Stables Castle has a secret back entrance

00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:51.333
a wheelchair ramp built for Ser Paul Pierce

00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:52.791
Synchronize your sundials

00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:56.958
If we time it right, we can slice through their lazy zone defense at the rear gates

00:01:56.958 --> 00:01:58.083
Ah, a backdoor cut

00:01:58.083 --> 00:01:58.916
Exactly

00:01:58.916 --> 00:02:00.333
But we’ll need a distraction

00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:01.791
That’s where you come in, Clint

00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:03.083
[Knocking]

00:02:03.416 --> 00:02:04.333
Who goes there?

00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:05.333
Oh, hello!

00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:07.541
I’m here from Big Balleros Brand

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.041
Would you be interested in purchasing some boots?

00:02:11.291 --> 00:02:12.083
Uh...

00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:14.166
How much for the sandals?

00:02:14.416 --> 00:02:15.708
Uh...great choice

00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:17.666
They're actually on sale for...

00:02:17.897 --> 00:02:19.125
400 gold

00:02:19.125 --> 00:02:20.208
Wait, what?

00:02:20.791 --> 00:02:26.166
Above the back door is a small window that leads to Donald Sterling’s
secret roost where he would send his racist ravens

00:02:26.166 --> 00:02:29.125
It’s easy to spot because all his birds were white

00:02:29.125 --> 00:02:31.541
Hoist me up, and I’ll sneak in and unlock the door

00:02:33.166 --> 00:02:35.583
Uh...they're autographed by Lonzo Ball

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:36.875
The GOAT

00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:39.833
Wait...aren't you on House Rockets?

00:02:40.208 --> 00:02:40.833
Um...

00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:42.791
Cuz if you are...

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:44.500
Please take me with you!

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.916
Why’s he taking so long?

00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:48.375
Do you–do you think he got caught?

00:02:50.166 --> 00:02:52.583
Welcome to the Stables Castle

00:02:53.541 --> 00:02:55.875
Once inside, we'll have to walk on eggshells

00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:58.958
You see, Sterling’s Roost is now the chamber of Chuck the Condor

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.333
the most horrifying mascot in the Realm

00:03:01.791 --> 00:03:03.541
All right now, you lead the way

00:03:03.666 --> 00:03:04.791
Me? Why me?

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.458
Do you want a guaranteed contract?

00:03:06.958 --> 00:03:07.708
Well, yeah, but—

00:03:07.708 --> 00:03:08.708
Then do–then go!

00:03:13.291 --> 00:03:14.083
[Crack]

00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:16.041
[Terrible screaching]

00:03:16.041 --> 00:03:17.541
Oh gods, he just ate him

00:03:17.541 --> 00:03:18.958
He just ate that journeyman guy!

00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:20.458
Oh no! He's coming back

00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:23.750
[Hotdog impact]

00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:29.250
Hunting for fowls. It's what I do

00:03:29.458 --> 00:03:32.250
I don’t know. Are condors considered fowl—WHOA

00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:37.500
[Hotdog impact]

00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:38.833
And-1

00:03:39.208 --> 00:03:41.875
We then descend past Phil Jackson’s Zen Garden

00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:45.541
and into the shrine to Kobe built by Kobe to honor himself

00:03:51.875 --> 00:03:52.708
Now what?

00:03:53.083 --> 00:03:53.791
I don't know

00:03:54.208 --> 00:03:56.333
There’s supposed to be a secret passageway

00:03:56.875 --> 00:03:58.250
James, check his closet

00:03:58.583 --> 00:04:00.583
Nothing...just some skeletons

00:04:00.583 --> 00:04:01.708
Here! Look

00:04:01.958 --> 00:04:02.958
Hm...

00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:04.666
I bet it's–ugh!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:05.750
Two!

00:04:06.333 --> 00:04:07.375
Four!

00:04:07.375 --> 00:04:07.958
[Mambas whipping]

00:04:07.958 --> 00:04:08.625
Ugh!

00:04:08.833 --> 00:04:10.333
Mambas! Black Mambas!

00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:10.791
Trevor!

00:04:10.791 --> 00:04:13.416
Uh okay, um, think! Think! Eight! It’s got to be eight

00:04:13.416 --> 00:04:14.416
Wait. Hold on! Hold on!

00:04:14.416 --> 00:04:16.666
It could be five! For each championship

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.125
No! It's...it's 81

00:04:20.125 --> 00:04:23.750
Kobe scored 81 on Ser Jalen, the Knight of Roses

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:24.375
Of course!

00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:27.875
Yes! Yes! He values individual accomplishments above all others

00:04:28.416 --> 00:04:29.750
Eight!

00:04:30.416 --> 00:04:31.458
One!

00:04:31.458 --> 00:04:34.750
[Stones grinding]

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:41.541
[Mechanism whirring]

00:04:42.208 --> 00:04:43.625
Trevor, are you okay?

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:45.583
Ugh, I’m suspended

00:04:46.041 --> 00:04:48.458
Go on without me. Finish what we started

00:04:48.458 --> 00:04:50.166
Better him than us, I suppose

00:04:50.166 --> 00:04:52.291
This will take us to the locker room doors

00:04:52.291 --> 00:04:54.458
Now in the event that we encounter the Jester,

00:04:54.458 --> 00:04:57.083
we implement Operation Jenner

00:04:57.083 --> 00:04:58.625
Cheers, thanks for coming out, um...

00:04:58.625 --> 00:05:03.666
So my squire year, some of the older blokes
take me to a whorehouse…to a whorehouse...

00:05:03.666 --> 00:05:06.291
Ugh...can’t I just cross him up or something?

00:05:06.291 --> 00:05:07.291
James, we’ve been through this

00:05:07.291 --> 00:05:10.583
He will whine and howl and the guards will be all over us

00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:14.083
It’s true, no one can whine like Blake, he’s the best

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.583
Second-best. Second-best. Sorry

00:05:16.791 --> 00:05:20.000
All right, on with the dress and off with the beard

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.083
Oh, I don't know. It's not just a beard

00:05:22.083 --> 00:05:23.291
I am The Beard

00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:27.208
Do it for Lord Commander

00:05:27.541 --> 00:05:28.541
[Sighs]

00:05:29.333 --> 00:05:31.041
Goodbye, old friend

00:05:31.041 --> 00:05:36.500
[Cutting]

00:05:37.041 --> 00:05:38.500
Your beard, James

00:05:39.041 --> 00:05:40.625
And your pubes

00:05:44.083 --> 00:05:45.833
You look…

00:05:46.208 --> 00:05:47.375
...stunning

00:05:47.375 --> 00:05:50.250
I just...I don’t know if I can do this

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:51.250
Don’t worry, James

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.416
Instead of acting like you’re getting fouled,

00:05:53.416 --> 00:05:55.750
just act like Kendall Jenner

00:05:56.291 --> 00:05:57.875
Uh...hey, baby

00:05:57.875 --> 00:06:00.041
Kendall? What are you doing here?

00:06:00.041 --> 00:06:01.833
I came here to...dunk

00:06:01.833 --> 00:06:02.833
I–I mean talk!

00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:04.291
But–but I’m at work

00:06:04.291 --> 00:06:07.666
Well, you haven’t been rebound—you haven't been responding to my ravens

00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:09.625
I don't think you sent me any ravens

00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:12.250
I was Eurostepping—I mean I was Europe modeling!

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:15.541
I mean I was in Europe–I was modeling in Europe, you see

00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:16.791
I'm an influencer model

00:06:16.791 --> 00:06:18.541
Kendall, are you okay?

00:06:18.541 --> 00:06:20.416
Sorry, lately I’ve been feeling a little beard

00:06:20.416 --> 00:06:22.291
I mean I’m feeling a little weird!

00:06:22.291 --> 00:06:23.041
I’m James Harden

00:06:23.041 --> 00:06:26.166
I mean, I’m Kendall Kardashian–Jenner?

00:06:26.166 --> 00:06:27.208
Ah, ref, where's the call?!

00:06:27.208 --> 00:06:29.750
And that’s when I make...the move

00:06:32.875 --> 00:06:34.083
What are you doing here?

00:06:34.083 --> 00:06:38.000
Doing something I should have done a long time ago

00:06:41.583 --> 00:06:42.125
[Slap]

00:06:42.125 --> 00:06:42.875
Gotcha, bitch!

00:06:42.875 --> 00:06:43.750
Daddy!

